          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Avoiding stevia comes down to reading every sweetener name on the label: stevia leaf extract, steviol glycosides, Reb A, Reb M and enzyme-modified versions all count. ON Gold Standard is the best everyday stevia-free whey, Truvani is the monk fruit pick, Naked's chocolate whey uses a little real sugar, and unflavored proteins remove the question entirely.
          </p>
